只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"MySQL connector plugin for DeepSeek Harness: configure connections in settings, switch per session from the composer, and expose mysql_query/mysql_tables/mysql_execute tools to every agent preset.","id":"gh:1337916824","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-mysql","slug":"1321928757/dsh-mysql","topics":["connector","database","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","mysql","sql","tools"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"MySQL connector plugin for DeepSeek Harness: configure connections in settings, switch per session f"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"rom the composer, and expose mysql_query/mysql_tables/mysql_execute tools to every agent preset."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-mysql"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"MySQL connections and guarded database tools for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Configure connections once, choose one or more per conversation, and let your agent route each call "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"to a selected data source."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"`dsh-mysql` is a profile bundle for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). It adds a settings page for multiple MyS"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"QL connections, a per-session connection picker beside the composer, and four guarded tools that eve"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ry agent preset can use. No preset edits are required."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> **Data boundary:** connection settings and passwords stay in your local DSH storage. Database sche"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ma and query results are sent to the LLM provider as ordinary tool output when the agent uses a data"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ry results are sent to the LLM provider as ordinary tool output when the agent uses a database tool."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Multiple connections:** keep separate development, staging, or production data sources in one DS"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"H installation.\n- **Per-session multi-selection:** each conversation independently selects zero, one"},{"id":"p9s3","text":", or multiple sources. Select/deselect takes effect immediately; clearing the last selection leaves "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"the session without database access until a source is selected again. A session with multiple config"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"ured sources starts empty; a sole configured source is auto-selected on first initialization. Select"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ion is runtime-only and is not restored after a DSH restart.\n- **One target per tool call:** when mu"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"ltiple sources are selected, the agent passes one selected `connectionId` to each tool call. A singl"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"e selected source may be inferred. Queries are never broadcast or merged across sources.\n- **Schema-"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"first workflow:** `mysql_tables` exposes readable columns, types, nullability, keys, and comments be"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"fore a query is written.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Requirements and compatibility"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- A DSH installation with the **Web profile** and Node.js **20 or newer**.\n- **DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 or new"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"er, below 0.3.0.** Version 0.2.0 of this plugin migrates its Typert RPC manifest to the DSH 0.2 stri"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ct codec contract (`create()` factory) and no longer loads on DSH 0.1.x — use plugin 0.1.11 there.\n-"},{"id":"p11s4","text":" A MySQL-compatible server reachable through the configured TCP host and port.\n- The connection form"},{"id":"p11s5","text":" currently supports host, port, username, password, default database, table allowlist, and write per"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"mission. It does not expose SSL/TLS, Unix socket/named-pipe, or charset options.\n- The `MAX_EXECUTIO"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"N_TIME` optimizer hint is intended for MySQL versions that support it (MySQL 5.7.8+). MariaDB may ha"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"ndle this hint differently; `SHOW`, `DESCRIBE`, and `EXPLAIN` do not receive the hint.\n- `mysql_tabl"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"es` discovers tables in `DATABASE()`. Configure a default database if you want schema discovery; a c"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"onnection without one can return an empty table list."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Security and permissions"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The plugin uses multiple guardrails, but it does not replace database permissions. Use a dedicated M"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ySQL account with the least privileges possible; for read-only work, a `SELECT`-only account is reco"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ount with the least privileges possible; for read-only work, a `SELECT`-only account is recommended."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Guardrail | What is enforced | Important boundary |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Statement type | `mysql_query` accepts read statements; `mysql_execute` accepts only `INSERT`/`UPD"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ATE`/`DELETE`; `mysql_ddl` accepts the supported table/view/index schema changes. | The tool layer i"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"s not a general SQL console. |\n| Row-write permission | `mysql_execute` requires the selected connec"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"tion's `allowWrite` flag. | Per connection, default off, with a separate risk acknowledgement. |\n| S"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"chema-change permission | `mysql_ddl` requires the independent `allowDdl` flag; changed/deleted targ"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"ets obey the allowlist, and explicit database qualifiers must match the default database. | Default "},{"id":"p15s7","text":"off with a separate acknowledgement; account/privilege and database-level statements stay refused. |"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"\n| Multi-statement SQL | Multiple statements and transaction/control statements are rejected. | Sche"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"ma changes are issued one statement per call. |\n| Table allowlist | Checks table references detected"},{"id":"p15s10","text":" after `FROM`, `JOIN`, `UPDATE`, and `INTO`. An empty list means no configured table restriction. | "},{"id":"p15s11","text":"This is a lexical check, not a full SQL parser. Forms such as `DESCRIBE t` or `SHOW CREATE TABLE t` "},{"id":"p15s12","text":"do not use those reference keywords; combine the allowlist with database-level grants. |\n| Result si"},{"id":"p15s13","text":"ze | The serialized tool response contains at most 2,000 rows and reports `truncated: true` when row"},{"id":"p15s14","text":"s were omitted. | The query is fetched before the response is truncated; this is not a server-side s"},{"id":"p15s15","text":"can or network limit. |\n| Credential exposure | Passwords are stored in local `connections.json`; th"},{"id":"p15s16","text":"e browser receives only `hasPassword`. | Query results, schema, and tool arguments are still sent to"},{"id":"p15s17","text":" the configured LLM provider. |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Passwords are stored as plain text in `$DSH_HOME/storages/dsh-mysql/connections.json`. Protect this "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"file with operating-system permissions and do not commit or share it."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Each conversation session independently selects zero, one, or multiple database sources; changes d"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"o not affect other sessions. An empty selection disables database tools for that session. Selection "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"state is kept in memory and reinitialized after a DSH restart.\n- Each tool call targets exactly one "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"source; when multiple sources are selected, `connectionId` is required. The plugin does not broadcas"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"t queries or merge results across databases.\n- `mysql_tables` uses the connection's `DATABASE()` val"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"ue, so schema discovery may be empty when no default database is configured. It does not browse arbi"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"trary databases.\n- The table allowlist is intentionally lightweight and checks common table-referenc"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"e positions rather than parsing every MySQL grammar form.\n- The 2,000-row limit applies to the retur"},{"id":"p18s9","text":"ned JSON payload after the database response has been fetched.\n- `mysql_execute` remains limited to "},{"id":"p18s10","text":"row writes; it does not provide transaction management or a confirmation workflow. `mysql_ddl` has n"},{"id":"p18s11","text":"o per-call approval; it is guarded by a per-connection opt-in, allowlist, and default-database bound"},{"id":"p18s12","text":"ary. Use a narrowly scoped database account.\n- Connection configuration is TCP-oriented and has no U"},{"id":"p18s13","text":"I for SSL/TLS, Unix sockets/named pipes, or character-set selection."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
